>>
Rule 1 (input tensor must be at least 2-D)
{v_1 : tensor} |= ndim(v_1) ≥ 2
>>
Rule 2 (num_lower must be negative or ≤ number of rows of the innermost matrices)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : int} |= (v_2 < 0) ∨ (v_2 ≤ shape(v_1, ndim(v_1) - 2))
>>
Rule 3 (num_upper must be negative or ≤ number of columns of the innermost matrices)
{v_1 : tensor, v_3 : int} |= (v_3 < 0) ∨ (v_3 ≤ shape(v_1, ndim(v_1) - 1))
